  "Figure: permissive callouts excluded (RADIUS OR CHAMFER; RADIUS, CHAMFER OR SQUARE; TOOL MARK OR DISTORTION PERMISSIBLE IN LOCKING AREA; CONCAVED OR CONICAL SURFACE BETWEEN TOP OF RING BASE WRENCHING CORNERS, AND AREA BETWEEN CORNERS).",
